From 5be1ac823349000c71b7e25ffd15dbb67b0aeee6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 05:02:27 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Show callers behind each call metric and attribute calls to
 team members

The call log names a call's owner only by extension id, so the Worker fell
back to whichever party had a name, which put outside caller-ID labels
("CHICAGO IL", "Possible spam call") on the Agent leaderboard. The owner
is now resolved from the account's extension list, with fallbacks that only
read the account's side of the call.

- Worker: extension directory (cached per isolate), owner resolution incl.
  the user who answered a queue call, extensionType on each call
- Team Performance: team members only by default, per-person inbound,
  outbound, connected, missed, voicemail and talk time, sortable
- Call Activity: clickable tiles and outcome bars, plus a Callers table
  listing the outside parties behind the selected metric
- Scheduled sync: same owner fix

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NzLbn2qdPQeiDrMjdJxvSJ
